WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.325 --> 00:39.837
=Episode 18=

00:39.885 --> 00:42.600
(The Heater Shakes the Palace)

00:43.120 --> 00:43.690
Mother-in-law,

00:43.800 --> 00:44.760
don't you usually

00:44.760 --> 00:46.200
spend most of your time here?

00:46.720 --> 00:47.519
I do.

00:47.719 --> 00:48.599
What is it, Hao?

00:48.599 --> 00:49.120
Alright.

00:49.679 --> 00:50.599
You two keep talking.

00:50.770 --> 00:52.000
I'm going to install something.

00:52.199 --> 00:53.519
It's way too cold in here.

00:54.279 --> 00:55.279
Oh, boy...

00:55.320 --> 00:56.359
Come on.

01:01.879 --> 01:02.760
What is he doing?

01:03.760 --> 01:04.559
I don't know.

01:04.800 --> 01:05.600
Father,

01:06.079 --> 01:07.160
this is very useful.

01:07.160 --> 01:08.399
You'll see in a moment.

01:13.679 --> 01:14.399
Your Highness,

01:14.399 --> 01:15.520
Chan brought this over.

01:15.520 --> 01:17.590
She said it's the findings
from the Ministry of Revenue.

01:21.799 --> 01:22.960
Just as I thought.

01:22.960 --> 01:23.560
Mother,

01:23.560 --> 01:24.280
Father,

01:24.280 --> 01:25.039
look at this.

01:26.000 --> 01:26.960
What is this?

01:27.762 --> 01:30.850
(The Hazards of Consanguineous Marriage,
Physical Deformities)

01:31.799 --> 01:32.880
It says here

01:33.370 --> 01:34.560
that marrying close relatives

01:34.560 --> 01:37.000
makes it easy to have
children with problems.

01:37.399 --> 01:39.359
(Proof from Ancient Teachings and Laws)
It also leads to frequent stillbirths.

01:39.400 --> 01:40.037
(Proof from Ancient Teachings and Laws)

01:40.159 --> 01:40.799
This...

01:45.320 --> 01:46.600
It's true, Mother-in-law.

01:48.760 --> 01:50.239
Wei the Fool told me about it.

01:50.480 --> 01:52.159
I didn't believe it at first,

01:52.210 --> 01:54.000
so I had
the Ministry of Revenue investigate.

01:54.359 --> 01:56.079
I never expected it to be true.

01:58.319 --> 02:00.760
Out of five hundred
families where relatives married,

02:01.239 --> 02:02.040
among them,

02:02.519 --> 02:04.439
over three hundred families

02:04.439 --> 02:05.920
had lost at least one child.

02:06.239 --> 02:08.359
There were even
more cases of stillbirths.

02:08.879 --> 02:09.680
Furthermore,

02:10.000 --> 02:12.200
there were over a hundred children

02:12.799 --> 02:14.120
born with birth defects.

02:16.120 --> 02:17.239
How can this be?

02:17.600 --> 02:19.390
The Ministry of Revenue
surely hasn't checked

02:19.439 --> 02:21.879
how many women died
in labor because of this.

02:24.079 --> 02:25.400
Died in labor?

02:31.640 --> 02:32.439
Father,

02:32.439 --> 02:33.079
Mother,

02:33.120 --> 02:35.280
why are you looking
at my sister like that?

02:35.400 --> 02:38.040
Your uncle wants Ning'an
to marry Zhangsun Chong.

02:40.159 --> 02:41.799
Zhangsun Chong?

02:42.599 --> 02:44.000
If the investigation is true,

02:44.000 --> 02:45.519
this must not happen, Father.

02:46.760 --> 02:47.560
Wang De.

02:48.000 --> 02:48.719
Yes, Your Majesty.

02:49.840 --> 02:52.159
Have the Ministry of Revenue
investigate this further.

02:52.159 --> 02:54.000
I want statistics for
the entire Great Yong.

02:54.159 --> 02:56.199
If this is indeed the case,

02:56.520 --> 03:00.319
it will seriously affect
the foundation of the Great Yong.

03:00.430 --> 03:01.680
By your command, Your Majesty.

03:05.719 --> 03:07.120
You looked into this

03:07.120 --> 03:09.039
because you
don't want to marry Chong, right?

03:09.159 --> 03:09.840
Yes, I don't.

03:10.759 --> 03:11.560
Why?

03:14.439 --> 03:16.319
Is it simply because you like Wei Hao?

03:16.919 --> 03:18.120
Even if there were no Wei Hao,

03:18.180 --> 03:20.080
I still wouldn't want to
marry Zhangsun Chong.

03:20.599 --> 03:21.960
He's so much older,

03:22.080 --> 03:24.240
has many concubines in his manor,

03:24.520 --> 03:26.039
and is a regular at the pleasure boats.

03:26.319 --> 03:27.360
When I'm out,

03:27.360 --> 03:29.199
I constantly hear rumors about him.

03:29.759 --> 03:30.800
One day,

03:30.800 --> 03:33.000
he's taking this concubine to the boats,

03:33.000 --> 03:34.479
the next day, it's another one.

03:35.039 --> 03:35.840
Mother,

03:36.000 --> 03:37.120
you wouldn't want me

03:37.120 --> 03:39.000
to marry such a lecherous man,
would you?

03:39.280 --> 03:40.599
Did such things really happen?

03:40.599 --> 03:41.759
It's absolutely true.

03:42.240 --> 03:43.360
And Uncle...

03:43.960 --> 03:45.439
Doesn't he just want to use me

03:45.439 --> 03:47.919
to ensure his family's wealth and glory?

03:48.000 --> 03:49.400
He's also the Crown Prince's uncle.

03:49.680 --> 03:51.159
Isn't it all the same?

03:51.360 --> 03:52.800
Why does he need to go through me?

03:55.680 --> 03:56.479
Alright.

03:57.520 --> 03:58.879
If you don't want to marry him,

03:59.360 --> 04:00.560
then you won't.

04:01.680 --> 04:02.479
But

04:02.719 --> 04:05.319
don't say things
that would offend your uncle.

04:05.319 --> 04:06.080
After all,

04:06.080 --> 04:07.680
your uncle has served

04:07.719 --> 04:09.120
this dynasty well.

04:09.719 --> 04:10.719
I know.

04:10.759 --> 04:12.639
I've never spoken carelessly outside.

04:13.080 --> 04:14.159
Thank you, Father,

04:14.159 --> 04:14.840
Mother.

04:15.599 --> 04:16.719
Silly girl.

04:19.439 --> 04:20.159
Alright.

04:20.759 --> 04:21.919
Mission accomplished.

04:23.120 --> 04:24.199
Do you guys feel

04:24.759 --> 04:25.759
how warm it is now?

04:31.120 --> 04:32.560
It is a bit warmer now.

04:39.280 --> 04:40.080
Wei Hao,

04:40.439 --> 04:41.400
what is this?

04:42.000 --> 04:43.599
This is called a heater.

04:43.599 --> 04:44.520
It works great.

04:44.599 --> 04:46.599
As long as you install
one of these in a room,

04:46.599 --> 04:48.240
the whole place warms up.

04:48.680 --> 04:49.919
It really is warm.

04:50.360 --> 04:51.159
Mother-in-law,

04:51.479 --> 04:52.840
this thing doesn't emit any smoke,

04:52.840 --> 04:54.199
so don't worry about the fumes.

04:54.240 --> 04:55.639
Even better, no carbon poisoning.

04:55.680 --> 04:57.520
I've already tested it out at home.

04:58.360 --> 04:58.840
Oh, right.

04:59.000 --> 05:00.079
This pipe here

05:00.079 --> 05:01.120
leads to the outside.

05:01.120 --> 05:03.120
Tell the maids to be careful
and never let it get blocked.

05:03.120 --> 05:04.360
Otherwise, it won't burn.

05:04.360 --> 05:06.199
The bottom part uses firewood.

05:06.720 --> 05:08.879
Firewood is much cheaper than charcoal.

05:10.360 --> 05:11.079
I see.

05:12.240 --> 05:13.560
To think such a small stove

05:13.639 --> 05:15.639
can warm up a room this big.

05:15.720 --> 05:16.560
Of course it can.

05:17.600 --> 05:18.399
Father-in-law,

05:18.800 --> 05:20.120
I'm not trying to nag you,

05:20.279 --> 05:21.720
but Mother-in-law's room is so cold.

05:21.720 --> 05:23.079
Couldn't you figure something out?

05:23.399 --> 05:24.839
You really are useless.

05:24.839 --> 05:25.360
Hey!

05:25.390 --> 05:26.759
- Wei the Fool.
- Wei the Fool.

05:28.240 --> 05:30.560
Why are you telling
my father he's useless?

05:31.839 --> 05:32.639
Father-in-law,

05:32.959 --> 05:33.600
look at this.

05:34.040 --> 05:36.120
Mother-in-law is usually alone

05:36.120 --> 05:37.639
and sometimes has to mind so many kids.

05:37.650 --> 05:39.360
You didn't even
think to find a solution.

05:39.360 --> 05:39.759
Seriously.

05:39.759 --> 05:41.560
Is it because I didn't
want it to be warm?

05:42.399 --> 05:44.040
The weather outside is freezing.

05:44.040 --> 05:45.079
The Ganlu Palace

05:45.079 --> 05:45.959
is also cold.

05:45.959 --> 05:47.000
When it's time to sleep,

05:47.000 --> 05:47.759
it's even colder.

05:49.040 --> 05:51.439
The entire court
couldn't think of a single way.

05:51.439 --> 05:52.310
But as soon as I came,

05:52.519 --> 05:53.839
I found the solution.

05:56.680 --> 05:58.639
Girl, there's another one outside.

05:58.639 --> 06:00.079
I'll install it at your place later.

06:02.079 --> 06:02.639
Oh?

06:03.600 --> 06:04.639
One for your wife,

06:04.639 --> 06:05.759
one for your mother-in-law,

06:05.800 --> 06:07.040
but none for me?

06:07.720 --> 06:10.360
I have to review
petitions at Ganlu Palace,

06:10.480 --> 06:11.680
and it is freezing over there.

06:12.079 --> 06:13.000
How

06:13.000 --> 06:15.480
can you not consider me?

06:15.720 --> 06:16.920
Give it to Father first.

06:17.079 --> 06:18.439
He needs to govern.

06:18.639 --> 06:20.680
He has to review many reports every day.

06:20.920 --> 06:22.120
Look at Father's hands.

06:22.199 --> 06:23.519
They're covered in chilblains.

06:26.480 --> 06:27.600
Father-in-law,

06:33.079 --> 06:34.360
I've run out of iron at home.

06:34.360 --> 06:35.600
And I can't buy any official iron.

06:35.600 --> 06:37.720
So, what should I do for you?

06:38.519 --> 06:39.319
I have some.

06:39.519 --> 06:40.360
I'll give it to you.

06:40.360 --> 06:41.220
How much do you need?

06:41.759 --> 06:42.639
A thousand jin.

06:42.639 --> 06:43.360
Do you have it?

06:43.360 --> 06:44.000
I do.

06:44.399 --> 06:45.079
In a moment,

06:45.199 --> 06:46.959
I'll have it sent to your mansion.

06:48.800 --> 06:49.600
Alright then.

06:50.920 --> 06:51.560
Girl,

06:51.639 --> 06:52.399
tomorrow,

06:52.400 --> 06:53.759
I'll bring one over to your place.

06:54.839 --> 06:55.639
Alright.

06:55.680 --> 06:56.839
Don't just stand there.

06:57.000 --> 06:58.279
Let's go sit over there.

06:58.600 --> 06:59.759
As for adding wood,

06:59.759 --> 07:01.319
you can just leave that to the maids.

07:06.519 --> 07:08.199
Winter was already hard to endure,

07:08.380 --> 07:10.279
but I've felt the cold more
since giving birth.

07:11.000 --> 07:13.560
Plus, several children are
always crawling and playing here.

07:14.160 --> 07:16.360
This is wonderful.

07:19.680 --> 07:20.600
Wei Hao,

07:21.199 --> 07:23.279
install one in Ganlu Palace later.

07:23.279 --> 07:24.800
I'll be using this from now on.

07:25.360 --> 07:26.439
It's so comfortable.

07:26.519 --> 07:27.600
Comfortable all over.

07:27.600 --> 07:28.240
Sure thing.

07:29.199 --> 07:29.920
Wei Hao,

07:30.000 --> 07:31.079
make one for me too.

07:31.079 --> 07:32.240
I review petitions as well,

07:32.279 --> 07:33.560
and I'm usually freezing.

07:33.560 --> 07:34.279
Don't worry.

07:34.500 --> 07:35.600
With a thousand jin of iron,

07:35.600 --> 07:36.680
I can make quite a few.

07:37.639 --> 07:38.470
Right, Father-in-law,

07:38.480 --> 07:39.879
I'll give you ten of them directly.

07:39.879 --> 07:41.439
You can install them wherever needed.

07:41.439 --> 07:42.360
It's simple, anyway.

07:43.000 --> 07:44.000
Ten isn't enough.

07:44.320 --> 07:44.920
How about this?

07:45.079 --> 07:47.199
I will give you 2,000 jin of iron.

07:47.439 --> 07:49.519
You deliver twenty of them to me.

07:50.120 --> 07:51.519
In the palaces of the inner court,

07:51.560 --> 07:53.399
each one needs to have one installed.

07:53.839 --> 07:55.000
And my bedroom

07:55.000 --> 07:56.240
needs one as well.

07:56.600 --> 07:57.399
Two for me.

07:57.560 --> 07:58.480
Three for you.

08:00.360 --> 08:01.160
Mother-in-law,

08:01.319 --> 08:02.480
if you run into trouble later,

08:02.480 --> 08:03.360
just come to me.

08:03.360 --> 08:04.319
I'll find a way for you.

08:05.450 --> 08:07.319
Father-in-law, I wasn't wrong
just now, was I?

08:07.319 --> 08:09.500
As an Emperor,
you can't even handle this little thing.

08:13.439 --> 08:14.240
Wei the Fool,

08:14.240 --> 08:15.360
shut your mouth.

08:15.850 --> 08:17.279
Seriously, with that mouth of yours,

08:17.279 --> 08:18.839
can't you just stop talking?

08:21.120 --> 08:21.920
Wei Hao,

08:21.920 --> 08:22.920
you're something else.

08:23.380 --> 08:25.160
I really don't know
how that mouth of yours

08:25.160 --> 08:27.199
managed to trick
my sister into marrying you.

08:27.199 --> 08:27.839
Tricked?

08:28.680 --> 08:29.519
I tricked her?

08:29.759 --> 08:30.600
You ask her.

08:30.720 --> 08:31.680
Ask Father-in-law.

08:31.720 --> 08:33.040
They were the ones who tricked me.

08:33.060 --> 08:34.480
I haven't even gone after them yet.

08:34.480 --> 08:35.800
They all teamed up to trick me.

08:35.800 --> 08:36.519
Shut up!

08:38.279 --> 08:39.879
(Why bring that up now?)

08:48.519 --> 08:49.319
Well,

08:50.210 --> 08:51.439
over at the Ministry of Works,

08:52.360 --> 08:53.399
Duan Lun has failed

08:53.399 --> 08:55.759
to produce brine
using the formula you gave.

08:56.480 --> 08:57.680
He's come to me several times

08:57.680 --> 08:58.800
asking you to go there.

08:59.360 --> 09:02.000
The position of Vice Minister
of Works has been vacant.

09:02.439 --> 09:03.720
Duan Lun is getting old,

09:03.720 --> 09:05.590
and it feels like there's
no one to succeed him.

09:06.279 --> 09:07.040
Wei Hao,

09:07.720 --> 09:10.000
I still believe in
your talent for investigating things.

09:10.000 --> 09:12.920
Would you like to take
a post at the Ministry of Works?

09:12.920 --> 09:13.639
What?

09:14.199 --> 09:15.200
Vice Minister of Works?

09:15.240 --> 09:16.320
I'm not doing that.

09:17.759 --> 09:18.600
Wei the Fool,

09:19.120 --> 09:20.919
you are a Marquis of the dynasty.

09:21.039 --> 09:22.879
You're appointed
Vice Minister right away.

09:22.879 --> 09:23.840
That's such a high-ranking post,

09:23.840 --> 09:24.799
and you actually refuse to go?

09:24.799 --> 09:26.159
I don't have the energy for that.

09:26.200 --> 09:27.159
Besides,

09:27.159 --> 09:28.960
my life goal isn't to be an official.

09:29.320 --> 09:30.360
Then, what is it?

09:30.440 --> 09:32.200
To sleep until I wake up naturally

09:32.200 --> 09:33.840
and count money until my hands cramp.

09:35.600 --> 09:36.080
You...

09:36.559 --> 09:37.720
You fool!

09:37.919 --> 09:40.360
How can you make
laziness sound so honorable?

09:40.759 --> 09:43.039
I can go to the Ministry of Works
to help him tomorrow.

09:43.200 --> 09:44.399
But I'm not being an official.

09:44.759 --> 09:45.639
I think

09:46.200 --> 09:47.720
being a Marquis is just fine.

09:48.519 --> 09:48.840
You...

09:48.840 --> 09:49.830
All right, Your Majesty.

09:50.360 --> 09:52.159
Wei Hao has not yet come of age.

09:52.159 --> 09:53.360
It is indeed inappropriate.

09:53.840 --> 09:54.879
As for the post,

09:54.880 --> 09:56.440
let's wait until after he comes of age.

09:59.180 --> 10:01.320
Mother-in-law, you
are the only one who's good to me.

10:05.679 --> 10:06.480
Oh, you.

10:06.799 --> 10:07.960
Let's eat first.

10:09.120 --> 10:09.720
Let's go.

10:29.787 --> 10:32.237
(Ministry of Works)

10:41.159 --> 10:42.399
Hand-carved bows?

10:42.670 --> 10:44.039
Is the Ministry of Works this poor?

10:50.840 --> 10:52.519
How much water can this thing even pump?

10:52.759 --> 10:53.720
What a mess.

10:57.000 --> 10:58.200
This support is wrong, too.

10:58.200 --> 11:00.110
Once the water level rises,
the support will collapse.

11:00.120 --> 11:01.480
Where did this brat come from?

11:01.519 --> 11:02.320
Out, out.

11:02.320 --> 11:03.480
Do not disturb me.

11:03.490 --> 11:04.550
You still don't believe me?

11:05.120 --> 11:05.639
Fine.

11:06.360 --> 11:07.039
Keep fixing it.

11:07.120 --> 11:09.320
When it collapses later,
don't say I didn't warn you.

11:17.000 --> 11:17.399
You...

11:17.399 --> 11:18.840
What is this?

11:18.919 --> 11:19.960
You gave me a fright.

11:20.000 --> 11:21.212
(The Beginning of All Achievements)

11:22.600 --> 11:23.519
What is this thing?

11:25.799 --> 11:27.159
A battering ram?

11:32.919 --> 11:33.890
The tension isn't enough.

11:34.120 --> 11:35.960
You need at least
two more sets of gears.

11:36.320 --> 11:37.759
But if we add two more sets,

11:38.279 --> 11:40.000
will it be able to handle the load?

11:41.080 --> 11:42.519
Get out of here.

11:45.279 --> 11:46.720
I came here to guide you,

11:46.720 --> 11:47.759
yet you're so ungrateful.

11:47.759 --> 11:49.240
(The Beginning of All Achievements)

11:49.240 --> 11:50.320
Marquis Wei,

11:51.279 --> 11:52.840
you've finally arrived.

11:53.559 --> 11:54.440
Minister Duan.

11:54.879 --> 11:55.600
Please.

11:55.600 --> 11:56.039
Let's go.

11:56.799 --> 11:57.879
The salt

11:57.879 --> 11:58.799
is still not right.

11:58.800 --> 12:00.990
There are still a lot of
impurities compared to what we want.

12:01.000 --> 12:03.320
But it's already
much better than before.

12:03.320 --> 12:04.080
The key issue is

12:04.080 --> 12:05.240
that the salt we've produced

12:05.240 --> 12:06.639
isn't quite fine enough.

12:07.480 --> 12:09.279
This smell is so familiar.

12:14.879 --> 12:16.000
Marquis, please don't!

12:24.825 --> 12:27.655
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

12:28.275 --> 12:31.675
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

12:32.445 --> 12:35.395
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

12:35.735 --> 12:38.435
♪Sigh and walk away♪

12:40.035 --> 12:43.505
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

12:43.505 --> 12:45.735
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

12:45.735 --> 12:47.845
♪Colors and darkness♪

12:47.845 --> 12:49.865
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

12:49.865 --> 12:54.225
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

12:55.665 --> 12:59.395
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

12:59.665 --> 13:03.265
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

13:03.425 --> 13:05.505
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

13:05.505 --> 13:10.295
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

13:10.515 --> 13:12.135
♪The world mistakes me♪

13:12.135 --> 13:14.475
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

13:14.545 --> 13:15.735
♪As the storm approaches♪

13:15.735 --> 13:18.135
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

13:18.345 --> 13:20.065
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

13:20.065 --> 13:22.045
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

13:22.215 --> 13:23.965
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

13:23.965 --> 13:26.065
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

13:26.065 --> 13:27.535
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

13:27.535 --> 13:29.765
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

13:29.985 --> 13:31.185
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

13:31.185 --> 13:33.705
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

13:33.835 --> 13:35.545
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

13:35.545 --> 13:36.825
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

13:36.975 --> 13:38.395
♪My wish has finally come true♪

13:38.395 --> 13:39.435
♪To stay by your side♪

13:39.435 --> 13:41.355
♪In this fleeting world♪

13:41.525 --> 13:44.775
♪We are free and happy♪

13:48.775 --> 13:50.555
♪From a nobody♪

13:50.555 --> 13:52.455
♪To someone now famous♪

13:52.565 --> 13:53.995
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

13:53.995 --> 13:56.505
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

13:56.605 --> 13:58.185
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

13:58.185 --> 14:00.255
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

14:00.465 --> 14:02.145
♪In this vast world♪

14:02.145 --> 14:04.145
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

14:04.295 --> 14:06.505
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

14:06.505 --> 14:08.095
♪Everything ends eventually♪

14:08.185 --> 14:09.685
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

14:09.685 --> 14:12.085
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

14:12.085 --> 14:13.795
♪No matter how time flies♪

14:13.795 --> 14:14.955
♪Even if the falling snow♪

14:14.955 --> 14:16.585
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

14:16.585 --> 14:17.625
♪All I want now♪

14:17.625 --> 14:19.725
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

14:19.725 --> 14:22.985
♪Year after year♪
